  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the update-rate setting for raw ranging parameters.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>These values map to the <c>UPDATE_RATE_*</c> constants on <see cref="T:Android.Ranging.Raw.RawRangingDevice" />. They are settings, not intervals in milliseconds. The interval depends on the ranging technology and its configuration.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/Uwb/+/7c9e03046ff41cc28cf794cc2eda306fbc40279e/ranging/framework/java/android/ranging/raw/RawRangingDevice.java">Android implementation of the update-rate constants and interval calculation.</a></format></para>
